      "reasons": [
        "The mechanism is overstated: the packet supports ERP as a first-line psychological treatment for OCD and notes adherence to prescribed exposure and response-prevention procedures, but it does not define ERP as exposure exercises while refraining from specific “usual response-prevention behaviors that maintain the problem.”",
        "The claim that its benefit depends on carrying out the work “as prescribed, including between sessions” is only partly supported; the packet says outcomes depend on adherence and between-session exposure practice, but not the stronger causal framing presented here."
